  "body": "```\r\nHTTP/1.1 200\r\nContent-Length: 55\r\nContent-Type: text/html;charset =gbk\r\n\r\n<script>document.write(document.characterSet)</script>\r\n```\r\nGives GBK in Chrome and Edge, windows-1252 in Firefox and Safari. I'm inclined to align with Firefox and Safari given that they match the RFC. Filing this as a reminder and to save the \"test\".",
